   "name": "water-bleach.md",
   "text": "title: Disinfecting water with bleach\naka: bleach, chlorine, chlorinate water, disinfect water with bleach\ntags: water treatment\nwarn: Use only plain unscented household bleach. Never use scented, colour-safe or \"with added cleaners\" bleach. Never mix bleach with ammonia or other cleaners.\nsee: water-boil, water-filter\nsource: CDC, Making water safe in an emergency (cdc.gov/water-emergency)\n\nWhen you cannot boil, plain household chlorine bleach kills most bacteria and viruses. It is less reliable than boiling against some parasites.\n\n## how\nFor bleach with 5 to 9 percent sodium hypochlorite (most household bleach):\n- 1 litre of clear water: 2 drops\n- 4 litres (1 gallon) of clear water: 8 drops\n- 20 litres (5 gallons) of clear water: 40 drops\n\nIf the water is cloudy, settle or strain it first. If it stays cloudy, double the dose.\n\nFor weak bleach with 1 percent sodium hypochlorite: 10 drops per litre of clear water.\n\n1. Add the drops.\n2. Stir or shake well.\n3. Wait at least 30 minutes before drinking.\n\n## safety\nRead the label to know the strength. Old bleach loses strength over time. Bleach does not remove chemicals, fuel or heavy metals. Keep bleach away from children.\n\n## store\nStore treated water in clean containers with lids, out of sunlight.\n\n## also said\n- bleach water\n- chlorine drops\n- how many drops of bleach per litre\n- bleach to make water safe to drink\n- can I use bleach to clean drinking water\n- how much bleach for a 20 litre jerrycan\n- bleach for 5 gallons of water\n- drops of chlorine in a gallon\n- i only have scented bleach can i use it\n- lemon scented bleach for water?\n- colour safe bleach drinking water\n- how long to wait after adding bleach\n- water still cloudy, how much bleach then\n- bleach is 1 percent, how many drops\n- how strong is my bleach\n- my bleach is very old does it still work\n- no way to boil water, only have bleach\n- no fire but i have chlorine\n- water tastes like swimming pool after bleach normal?\n- can bleach clean water with petrol in it\n- mixing bleach and ammonia\n- sodium hypochlorite water treatment\n- chlorinate water emergency\n- disinfect water with household bleach\n- how to store water after bleach\n- bleach kills parasites in water?\n- shake after adding bleach?\n- 2 drops 1 litre right?\n- how much household bleach in rain barrel water\n- we have a bottle of chlorine, how to use for drinking water\n- is bleach as good as boiling\n- keep bleach away from kids\n- treating tap water with bleach after flood warning\n- how many drops of 8 percent bleach in 1 liter\n- dosage bleach for drinking water\n- clorox in water bottle how many\n"
